<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/47/eng@/~cl_14__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the work of erection of a building has commenced immediately before the date of coming into operation of this Act, the provisions of the principal Act applicable to the erection of the building shall continue to apply as if this principal Act has not been amended by this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/47/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/47/eng@/~cl_14__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/47/eng@/~cl_14> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/47/eng@> .
