<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/47/eng@/~cl_14__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the work of erection of a building has been suspended immediately before the date of coming into operation of this Act and is to resume on or after the date of coming into operation of this Act, the provisions of the principal Act applicable to the erection of the building shall continue to apply as if the principal Act has not been amended by this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/47/eng@> .
